      "record": "productKits (body part)",
      "reason": "The glass reads as solid white because the kit's body layer is opaque white (alpha 255, RGB 253 inside the glass), and so is the glass layer of the master PSD it was cut from (7. GBCrcl30GlCap..psd, sha256 matches the kit's plate). No transparent Circle 30 ml glass exists in productKits, productPlates, the builder bodies or the master; the only see-through Circle 30 photographs in the repo are the bone heroes for GBCrcl30GlCap and GBCrcl30SpryMattGl, which show the cap beside the bottle, and the stage never reaches a hero while a kit exists. Fixing it needs new glass artwork (a re-matted body layer) or a stage rule, not a data correction."
    },
